ementor-image-box-description\">In the realm of primary and secondary education, Seth M. R. Jaipuria School has emerged as a pioneer in providing high-quality education on a national level. Since its inception in Lucknow in 1992, the network of Jaipuria Schools has expanded rapidly, with over 60+ campuses and a student body exceeding 55,000.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62dcdcc e-con-full e-grid e-con e-child\" data-id=\"62dcdcc\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a570112 elementor-vertical-align-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"a570112\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Ranked 1st in UP<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">(Education World, 2023) <\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-39eea5f elementor-vertical-align-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"39eea5f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">First Indian School to be featured by GGSC<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">University of California, Berkeley<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8042b23 elementor-vertical-align-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"8042b23\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.defaul